<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BTD UNIVERSE — Hub Oficial</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #030306;
            --ink: #f5f5f7;
            --cyan: #00f0ff;
            --purple: #7000ff;
            --pink: #ff007f;
            --gold: #ffd166;
            --sans: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
            --mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
        }
        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: var(--sans);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 3px, rgba(0,212,255,0.005) 3px, rgba(0,212,255,0.005) 4px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 999;
        }

        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            z-index: 200;
            padding: 1.2rem 4rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(3,3,6,0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.1);
        }
        .nav-logo {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--cyan);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .banner-hero {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 55vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10rem 2rem 5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3,3,6,0.4) 0%, rgba(3,3,6,1) 100%), url('btdbanner.png') center/cover no-repeat;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.15);
        }
        .logo-container img {
            max-width: 200px;
            height: auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(0,240,255,0.3));
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
        }
        
        .role-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { .role-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,240,255,0.05);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .card:hover { 
            border-color: var(--pink);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255,0,127,0.05);
        }
        .card h3 {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 0;
            color: var(--cyan);
        }

        .drive-section {
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255,0,127,0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,0,127,0.2);
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .drive-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: rgba(0,240,255,0.1);
            color: var(--ink);
            border: 1px solid var(--cyan);
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }
        .drive-btn:hover {
            background: var(--cyan);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,240,255,0.4);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <a href="#" class="nav-logo">BTD UNIVERSE</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="banner-hero">
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="btdlogo.png" alt="BTD Logo">
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        
        <!-- TRÍADE CONCEITUAL -->
        <div class="role-grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>// CURADORIA</h3>
                <p>Articulação estética e seleção de ativos transmídia. Supervisão de ecossistemas visuais, fonográficos e de teledramaturgia voltados para o mercado internacional.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>// GRIOT RUNNER</h3>
                <p>Preservação e transmissão da memória immemorial através de estruturas tecnológicas modernas. Conexão ancestral e gerenciamento de narrativas de impacto global.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>// ARTESANATO</h3>
                <p>Desenvolvimento meticuloso e autoral das memórias, arquiteturas musicais e roteiros originais (Master Screenplay). Construção orgânica e soberana da propriedade intelectual.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- LINK PARA O DRIVE CONCEITUAL -->
        <section class="drive-section">
            <h2 style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0; color: var(--gold);">
                Acesso ao Acervo Estratégico
            </h2>
            <p style="max-width: 600px; margin: 1rem auto 0; font-size: 15px; color: rgba(245,245,247,0.7);">
                Explore as bíblias de pitch, roteiros consolidados, linhas fonográficas protegidas por blockchain e documentos estruturais do ecossistema.
            </p>
            <a href="https://google.com" target="_blank" class="drive-btn">
                // Entrar no Drive Conceitual
            </a>
        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>
